Herdr Navigation includes modified Herdr App tab-bar and picker code and a derived layout.
Upstream: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Source version: Herdr App 0.1.11
Original files: defaults/mods/tabs/main.js, defaults/mods/picker/main.js, their mod.json manifests, and defaults/layouts/main.json.

Modifications add multi-pane titles, title truncation, optional session metadata, and agent-state filtering.
